title: Aggregate hook results and handle blocking decisions
updated_at: "2026-08-02T04:22:27Z"
---
When multiple hooks match, run them in sequence or parallel. If any returns block (exit 2 or decision:deny/block), stop execution and return block decision. Collect additionalContext from all hooks. For PreToolUse, support updatedInput to modify tool parameters.